---
import H1 from '../components/h1.astro'
import InfoLayout from '../layouts/InfoLayout.astro'
---

<InfoLayout>
  <div
    class="p-4 sm:pt-8 sm:px-12 pb-20 min-h-dvh flex flex-col justify-between gap-32"
  >
    <div class="space-y-4 sm:space-y-12">
      <H1>Get to know Sergei</H1>
        <p class="text-xl xl:text-2xl text-zinc-200 text-balance">Hi there. I'm Sergei. Nice to meet you</p>
        <p class="text-xl xl:text-2xl text-zinc-400 text-balance">I've been work in the web space since 2005. Yes, that long. Currently, I'm specialising in all things web, servers and LLM/AI automation. Primarily in ecommerce space.
        </p>
        <p class="text-xl xl:text-2xl text-zinc-400 text-balance">I've done a lot. Massive multinational <strong>Magento</strong> store, interesting CMS sites with Craft CMS and more Shopify Plus store than I dare count.</p>
        <p class="text-xl xl:text-2xl text-zinc-400 text-balance">I ran a web agency & a kids clothing brand.</p>
        <p class="text-xl xl:text-2xl text-zinc-400 text-balance">And everything in between.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-2 text-base sm:text-lg">
      <h2
        class="px-4 text-zinc-400 underline underline-offset-4 decoration-zinc-500"
      >
        Achievements
      </h2>

      <ul class="px-4 text-zinc-400 list-disc list-outside">
        <li>Shopify Certified Developer 2025 onwards</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</InfoLayout>
